<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Answer Parsing Exclusion Rates</h3>

<figure id="A1.T11" class="ltx_table">
