<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Example Flip Cases</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present representative flip cases from FlipBank to illustrate the phenomenon. Each example shows the original question, the paraphrase, and the model’s contradictory responses.</p>
</div>
